{
 "priority": 2,
 "source_bins": [
  "sound_auth.bin",
  "talk.bin"
 ],
 "strings": {
  "You sure about that, asshole!?": "",
  "You sure about that!?": "",
  "Look, I don't wanna fight you.": "",
  "I can turn and walk away if you want.": "",
  "You want me to leave, I'll leave.": "",
  "Tch. Coward.": "",
  "Same old story.": "",
  "How long has it been since\nwe've seen each other? A year now?": "",
  "How long has it been since we've\nseen each other? A year now?": "",
  "It was the day Kaito-san got expelled.": "",
  "You were... pretty upset by it.": "",
  "You remember?\nI saw the pain on your face.": "",
  "It was fucked up.\nThe boss brought you in to save Kaito-aniki.": "",
  "I remember now.\nThe boss brought you in to save Kaito-aniki.": "",
  "But it was too late.\nHe was gonna get expelled no matter what.": "",
  "Even so, you gave him the best\ndefense a man could ask for.": "",
  "Still, you gave it your best shot.\nGave him a real lawyer's defense.": "",
  "Yeah, and Hamura's had his eye\non me ever since.": "",
  "Yeah, and Hamura's had his eye on me\never since.": "",
  "You know, you're doing pretty well\nfor yourself, Higashi.": "",
  "...You know, you're doing pretty well\nfor yourself, Higashi.": "",
  "Looks like you're moving up the ranks.\nI heard this used to be Kaito-san's arcade.": "",
  "The hell do you know!?": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Guess I touched a nerve.)</color>": "",
  "Hamura practically controls\nthe Matsugane Family now.": "",
  "The Matsugane Family changed.\nThe captain controls everything now.": "",
  "With Kaito-aniki gone, Matsugane-san's\ncommand has slowly slipped away.": "",
  "With Kaito-aniki gone,\nthe boss's command has slowly slipped away.": "",
  "This would've never happened if he'd stayed...": "",
  "This never would've happened\nif he'd stayed...": "",
  "Couldn't you have done something?\nYou just sat and watched while he took control.": "",
  "Couldn't you have done something?\nYou just sat and watched while the captain took control.": "",
  "Easy for you to say.\nI couldn't have done shit.": "",
  "All on my own? Easy for you to say.\nI couldn't have done shit.": "",
  "...Maybe not.": "",
  "By the way, what ever happened\nto the family's 100 mil?": "",
  "By the way, what <font_kind=yakuza_italic>did</font_kind> happen to the\nMatsugane's hundred mil? I was always curious.": "",
  "Did they ever get the money back?\nOr find the thief?": "",
  "Fuck off.\nThat's none of your business.": "",
  "(Kaito-san's probably waiting for me\nback at the office...) ": "",
  "Yo. How'd it go?": "",
  "Yo. You're back.": "",
  "Fine. I ended up going in that arcade.\nTalked to Higashi.": "",
  "Yeah. I found my way into Charles eventually.\nTalked to Higashi, too.": "",
  "He caught you, huh?": "",
  "Nah, I just wanted to have a chat.": "",
  "No, not exactly.": "",
  "Anything come of it?": "",
  "So how'd it go?": "",
  "First off, Matsugane-san's completely\nlost control of Hamura.": "",
  "First off, the Matsugane family...\nThe boss's completely lost control of Hamura.": "",
  "Apparently Higashi has no choice now\nbut to follow his captain's orders.": "",
  "Apparently, Higashi has no choice now\nbut to follow his captain's orders.": "",
  "Fucked up...": "",
  "When we talked, though... It felt like\nI was talking to the same old Higashi.": "",
  "Still... When we talked...\nit felt like I was talking to the same old Higashi.": "",
  "Didn't look \"same old\" to me.": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(If Higashi's really changed, I bet it all started\nafter the break-in that got Kaito-san kicked out.)</color> ": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(I wonder what came of all that...)</color> ": "",
  "You know a year ago,\nwhen you got expelled from the family?": "",
  "Uh-huh?": "",
  "It was 'cause someone stole\n100 mil from the safe, right?": "",
  "A hundred mil got taken from the family safe...\nand you had to take responsibility for it, right?": "",
  "Yeah, what about it?": "",
  "What about it?": "",
  "What ended up happening with that?\nDid you ever hear anything?": "",
  "Apparently Higashi got it all back.\nAt least, according to Ayabe.": "",
  "Higashi did? But how?": "",
  "Higashi did? But how...?": "",
  "Not a clue. I would've had to fork up\nanother 200 grand for more info.": "",
  "I didn't have the cash, so I dropped it.\nHaven't brought it up since.": "",
  "Sounds like Ayabe has a lot to tell us.": "",
  "Sounds like Ayabe's got a lot\nmore information for us.": "",
  "It'll cost you.\nBet you can find him at Tender 'round now.": "",
  "Kaito-san... How long's it been\nsince you saw Higashi?": "",
  "Kaito-san... Was this your first time\nseeing Higashi again?": "",
  "Today was the first time\nsince getting the boot.": "",
  "Yeah. At least, since I got the boot.": "",
  "Hamura would've been all over him\nif we kept in touch.": "",
  "I didn't wanna weigh him\ndown, y'know?": "",
  "I didn't wanna weigh him down, y'know?": "",
  "I wonder what Hamura'll do next...": "",
  "Wonder what Hamura's gonna try next...": "",
  "He'll be back here soon enough.\nIt's just a matter of time.": "",
  "Wouldn't even be surprised\nif he tried to off us.": "",
  "Hell, wouldn't even be surprised\nif he tried to off us.": "",
  "You think we pissed him off\nthat much?": "",
  "Well he doesn't want us catching\nthe Mole, that's for sure.": "",
  "Whatever it takes to keep us from\ncatching the Mole.": "",
  "Other than that,\nI think he just hates our guts. ": "",
  "Of course, it doesn't help that\nhe just hates our guts. ": "",
  "Damn, even though we're the\nreason he's a free man?": "",
  "Seriously. Even though we're the reason\nhe's a free man?": "",
  "Guess we just can't catch a break.": "",
  "You heading to Tender? Whatever info\nAyabe's got is gonna cost you, y'know.": "",
  "Hope I have enough, then.\nI'll figure something out if not.": "",
  "Yo. What's up?": "",
  "Welcome back, Tak.": "",
  "Hey.\nCome right in.": "",
  "So, rumor has it you've been\nserving drinks to a dirty cop?": "",
  "Word is, you've been keeping a dirty cop\n'round here.": "",
  "In my bar?\nI take offense to that.": "",
  "Really now... A corrupt official, in my bar?\nI take offense to that.": "",
  "Heh. Ayabe here yet?": "",
  "Ayabe here yet?": "",
  "He said he's heading over.": "",
  "Soon. He said he's heading over.": "",
  "Before that though, Tak. I've got a little job\nI'd like you to handle, if you would.": "",
  "Before that though, Tak. You've got good timing—\nthere's something I need you to do.": "",
  "A job, huh?": "",
  "Only the best detective in Kamurocho\ncan handle this case.": "",
  "A job for only the best detective\nin Kamurocho.": "",
  "Oh yeah?\nWell then how can I refuse?": "",
  "Huh... Well, I can't exactly say no\nafter that.": "",
  "Aw, you're blushing.\nI mean it, though.": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Masuda always has had a way with words...)</color> ": "",
  "Then clue me in.": "",
  "So what's the job?": "",
  "Would if I could.": "",
  "No idea.": "",
  "I never actually asked. The client's a regular\nof mine, though, so you don't need to worry.": "",
  "I never actually asked. Still, the client's a regular\nof mine, so you don't need to worry.": "",
  "Anyway, you'll need to head over to a place\ncalled Hills Garden on Park Boulevard.": "",
  "Right now?": "",
  "Right now. And I'll let you know\nwhen Ayabe-san comes in.": "",
  "C'mon, detective. It's not like you\nto turn down a paying job.": "",
  "You're not going to turn down a paying job,\nare you, Yagami?": "",
  "You got me there.": "",
  "...Got me there.": "",
  "It's Ayabe.\nMasuda told me to give you a ring.": "",
  "It's Ayabe.\nTender's barman told me to give you a ring.": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Guess Masuda kept his word.)</color> ": "",
  "You need something?": "",
  "Yeah, info I hear you've got.": "",
  "I'm looking for more information.": "",
  "You got the cash?\nI'm done handing out freebies.": "",
  "You got the cash for it?\nI'm done handing out freebies.": "",
  "Oh, and the price'll depend on\nwhat you wanna know.": "",
  "It just so happens you already\ntold Kaito-san the price. 200 grand.": "",
  "The price...? Well, you've already given\nKaito-san a quote of 200 grand.": "",
  "You know how all that money got stolen from\nthe Matsugane? I want to know what happened to it.": "",
  "A year ago, the Matsugane Family got robbed of\n100 million. I want to know what happened to it.": "",
  "And what, I said it'd be 200k?": "",
  "That's what he told me.": "",
  "In that case, let's make it 100.\nPrice drops with age.": "",
  "Well, since that's old news,\nlet's drop it down to 100.": "",
  "Oh, does it?": "",
  "Whoa. Really?": "",
  "Look, I'm not pulling the numbers outta my ass.\nI've got calculations. A system.": "",
  "Anyway, I'll drop by your place tomorrow.\nHave the cash ready.": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Ayabe's stopping by tomorrow.\nMight be a good idea to get some shuteye...)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Ayabe said his info will cost 100 grand.\nI've gotta have the money by tomorrow, so...)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(I could always ask Saori-san or Masuda over at Tender\nif they've got any work for me.)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Or maybe I can just head to L'Amant, hit the tables.)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Phew, I'm exhausted...)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Actually, not yet.\nThere's still more I need to do first.) </color>": "",
  "...Hello?": "",
  "...Yeah, hello?": "",
  "It's Ayabe.": "",
  "Wake up and look behind you.": "",
  "Look behind you.": "",
  "Next time just knock, would you?": "",
  "Knock next time, would you?": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Those must be the files he promised.)</color> ": "",
  "Those the files on\nthe Matsugane robbery investigation?": "",
  "So, those are the investigation files\nfor the Matsugane case?": "",
  "Investigation?\nWhat have you been smoking?": "",
  "No yakuza's gonna report\na robbery on their office.": "",
  "I mean, they'd have cops\nswarming the place.": "",
  "Wait...": "",
  "Huh...": "",
  "The Matsugane incident was never a formal case.\nI rounded all of this up myself.": "",
  "You have the cash?": "",
  "100 grand, just like you asked.": "",
  "Nice.": "",
  "Much obliged.": "",
  "Everything's so clear.\nThese are practically real case files.": "",
  "You wanna know how long\nI spend on this stuff?": "",
  "You know how long\nI spend on this stuff?": "",
  "Way more than I do on the streets,\nthat's for sure.": "",
  "Longer than I do on the beat,\nthat's for damn sure.": "",
  "Someone's proud of himself.": "",
  "Heh. Now then. This is the floor plan\nfor the Matsugane Family office.": "",
  "Heh heh... This is the floor plan\nfor the Matsugane office.": "",
  "It's from a year ago, when the break-in happened.\nThey haven't remodeled since then, have they?": "",
  "Doubt it.": "",
  "Not that I know of.": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(So the question is, how did the thief break in,\nget the money, <font_kind=yakuza_italic>and</font_kind> make it out?)</color> ": "",
  "So. To avoid getting seen by the security camera,\nthe thief snuck in behind a guy coming in.": "",
  "Now, the robbery. To avoid the cameras,\nthe thief snuck in behind a Matsugane guy coming in.": "",
  "Once they were in the camera's blind spot,\nhe pistol-whipped the guy and knocked him out cold.": "",
  "Then, once they were in the camera's blind spot,\nhe pistol-whipped the guy and knocked him out cold.": "",
  "At the time, Kaito was the only one\nwatching over the office.": "",
  "That's why the thief went in at 3 PM.\nBarely any guards to deal with.": "",
  "That's why the thief went in at 3 PM,\nwhen there were barely any guards to deal with.": "",
  "All he had to do was point his gun\nat Kaito and get him to open the safe.": "",
  "And so, he pointed his gun at Kaito...\nand made him open the safe.": "",
  "But there was only one thief.\nWhy didn't Kaito-san fight back?": "",
  "What would you do if a guy pointed a gun at your head,\nthen shot the ceiling to prove his point?": "",
  "What would you do if a guy had you at gunpoint,\nthen took a shot at the ceiling?": "",
  "Even a guy like him would freeze up under that kind\nof pressure. You really gonna chance playing hero?": "",
  "Doesn't matter who you are.\nAnyone would freeze up under that kinda pressure.": "",
  "Once the safe was open, the thief smacked Kaito, too.\nKnocked him out just like the last guy.": "",
  "Then, once the safe was open,\nthe thief knocked Kaito out cold.": "",
  "And that's how the story ends.": "",
  "And that about sums it up.": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(So he broke in specifically when nobody was around.\nBallsy, raiding a yakuza office with just a pistol.)</color> ": "",
  "Sounds a little too well thought-out.": "",
  "A lot of planning went into this.\nMight even be a little too planned out.": "",
  "This guy was a pro.\nAnd consider this.": "",
  "Yeah. Not only was this guy a pro...": "",
  "If he didn't know when the office would be empty,\nhe'd never have been able to pull it off.": "",
  "Clearly he had a contact on the inside.": "",
  "Way I see it, this guy must have had\na contact on the inside.": "",
  "Maybe, but still...": "",
  "I see your point, but...": "",
  "I don't understand why Kaito-san reacted like that.\nNormally he'd have killed the guy or died trying.": "",
  "I don't get why Kaito-san reacted like that.\nNormally he'd put up way more of a fight.": "",
  "Heh, thought you'd say that.": "",
  "Heh. Thought you'd say that.": "",
  "That was all just a warm-up.\nThis next bit is what's worth the 100 grand.": "",
  "See, everything I just told you was the leadup.\nThis next bit is what's worth the 100 grand.": "",
  "So. I said Kaito was alone\nin the office, right?": "",
  "I said Kaito was alone\nin the office, right?": "",
  "Well... Turns out someone\nelse was there, too.": "",
  "The truth is, there was someone else\nthere with him.": "",
  "He saw the whole thing go down, but Kaito's\nthe guy who took the proverbial bullet.": "",
  "He was right at the scene of the crime,\nand he saw the whole thing go down.": "",
  "Kaito never did tell anyone else that Higashi\nfroze like a deer in the headlights.": "",
  "You can figure out the rest.\nKaito never told anyone about Higashi.": "",
  "Instead, he took the fall for the missing\n100 mil and got himself tossed out of the family.": "",
  "He just took the fall for the missing 100 mil,\nand got himself kicked out.": "",
  "Tch, why am I not surprised? That sounds\nexactly like what Kaito-san would do.": "",
  "Everything makes more sense now... And yeah.\nThat sounds like Kaito-san.": "",
  "Don't it?": "",
  "But what happened next? How did Higashi\nget the money back? It couldn't have been easy.": "",
  "But what happened next? Higashi got that 100 million\nback somehow. What did he do?": "",
  "He chased the thief down\nand took it back.": "",
  "He chased the thief down,\nand <font_kind=yakuza_italic>took</font_kind> it back.": "",
  "Thought that'd get Kaito back into\nthe fold. Which it obviously didn't.": "",
  "Thought that'd get Kaito back into the fold,\nthough it obviously didn't.": "",
  "Thing is, he needed access to\nthe police database to search for faces.": "",
  "Anyway, he wanted to use the police database\nto search for the guy's face.": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(The police database? That means...)</color> ": "",
  "I see it now. That's why\nyou know what you do, huh?": "",
  "I get it. So... that's when Higashi\nwent to you.": "",
  "What makes you so sure?": "",
  "That's the only way you'd know about this case.\nThey never filed a police report, after all.": "",
  "Haha, ding ding ding.": "",
  "Pretty sharp.": ""
 },
 "ref_tm": {
  "No, not exactly.": "ไม่ ไม่ใช่แบบนั้น",
  "So how'd it go?": "แล้วเป็นไงบ้าง",
  "Yeah, what about it?": "เออ แล้วมันเป็นไงอีกล่ะ?",
  "What about it?": "มันเป็นไงเหรอ?",
  "No idea.": "ไม่รู้เหมือนกัน",
  "Right now?": "ตอนนี้เลยเหรอ?",
  "...Hello?": "...ฮัลโหล?",
  "Wait...": "เดี๋ยวก่อน...",
  "Huh...": "หา...",
  "Nice.": "เยี่ยม",
  "Much obliged.": "ขอบใจมากนะ",
  "What makes you so sure?": "อะไรทำให้นายมั่นใจขนาดนั้น?"
 }
}
